{"id":"82da26f4ff841520","group":"14","path":"14/14-thm-finite-set-object-classifier.md","title":"Theorem — 对象分类子的有限集合呈现","display":"Theorem — 对象分类子的有限集合呈现","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane & Moerdijk)","book_abbrev":"14","label":"14-thm-finite-set-object-classifier","aliases":["14-thm-finite-set-object-classifier"],"display":"Theorem — 对象分类子的有限集合呈现","depends_on":["[[14-df-presheaf-category]]","[[14-df-object-classifier-topos]]","[[14-df-functor-full-subcategory]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane &amp; Moerdijk)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"14"},{"key":"label","html":"14-thm-finite-set-object-classifier"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>14-thm-finite-set-object-classifier</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"Theorem — 对象分类子的有限集合呈现"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"300365f146cacc8a\" href=\"?note=300365f146cacc8a\" title=\"14-df-presheaf-category\">14-df-presheaf-category</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"98293f53034b1166\" href=\"?note=98293f53034b1166\" title=\"14-df-object-classifier-topos\">14-df-object-classifier-topos</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"1601eff2507fda14\" href=\"?note=1601eff2507fda14\" title=\"14-df-functor-full-subcategory\">14-df-functor-full-subcategory</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{Fin}\">\\(\\mathbf{Fin}\\)</span> 为有限集合的骨架：对象 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，对应 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[n]=\\{0,\\ldots,n-1\\}\">\\([n]=\\{0,\\ldots,n-1\\}\\)</span>，箭头为所有函数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[n]\\to[m]\">\\([n]\\to[m]\\)</span>，恒等与复合为函数恒等与复合。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal B:=\\mathbf{Set}_{\\mathcal U}^{\\mathbf{Fin}}=\\widehat{\\mathbf{Fin}^{op}}\">\\(\\mathcal B:=\\mathbf{Set}_{\\mathcal U}^{\\mathbf{Fin}}=\\widehat{\\mathbf{Fin}^{op}}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U:\\mathbf{Fin}\\to\\mathbf{Set}_{\\mathcal U}\">\\(U:\\mathbf{Fin}\\to\\mathbf{Set}_{\\mathcal U}\\)</span> 取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U(n)=[n]\">\\(U(n)=[n]\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U((n,m,h))=([n],[m],h)\">\\(U((n,m,h))=([n],[m],h)\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{Fin}:=\\bigl(\\mathbb N,\\{(n,m,h)\\mid n,m\\in\\mathbb N,\\ h:[n]\\to[m]\\},\\ ((n,m,h)\\mapsto n),\\ ((n,m,h)\\mapsto m),\\ (n\\mapsto(n,n,1_{[n]})),\\ (((m,k,g),(n,m,h))\\mapsto(n,k,g\\circ h))\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathbf{Fin}:=\\bigl(\\mathbb N,\\{(n,m,h)\\mid n,m\\in\\mathbb N,\\ h:[n]\\to[m]\\},\\ ((n,m,h)\\mapsto n),\\ ((n,m,h)\\mapsto m),\\ (n\\mapsto(n,n,1_{[n]})),\\ (((m,k,g),(n,m,h))\\mapsto(n,k,g\\circ h))\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal B:=\\operatorname{FunCat}(\\mathbf{Fin},\\mathbf{Set}_{\\mathcal U}),\\qquad U:=\\bigl(n\\mapsto[n],\\ (n,m,h)\\mapsto([n],[m],h)\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal B:=\\operatorname{FunCat}(\\mathbf{Fin},\\mathbf{Set}_{\\mathcal U}),\\qquad U:=\\bigl(n\\mapsto[n],\\ (n,m,h)\\mapsto([n],[m],h)\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{IsObjectClassifier}(\\mathcal B,U).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{IsObjectClassifier}(\\mathcal B,U).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>精确来源：原书 VIII.4 Theorem 3，印刷 p.437。Fin 是一个对象自由生成的有限余完备范畴，因此 Fin^op 是自由有限完备范畴；到预层拓扑斯的几何态射由 Fin^op 上左正合函子分类，等价于指定一个对象。方向是 Set^Fin，而非误写 Set<sup>(Fin</sup>op)。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"14-df-presheaf-category","status":"resolved","id":"300365f146cacc8a","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-presheaf-category]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-object-classifier-topos","status":"resolved","id":"98293f53034b1166","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-object-classifier-topos]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-functor-full-subcategory","status":"resolved","id":"1601eff2507fda14","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-functor-full-subcategory]]","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathbf{Fin}","display":false},{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"[n]=\\{0,\\ldots,n-1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"[n]\\to[m]","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal B:=\\mathbf{Set}_{\\mathcal U}^{\\mathbf{Fin}}=\\widehat{\\mathbf{Fin}^{op}}","display":false},{"tex":"U:\\mathbf{Fin}\\to\\mathbf{Set}_{\\mathcal U}","display":false},{"tex":"U(n)=[n]","display":false},{"tex":"U((n,m,h))=([n],[m],h)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf{Fin}:=\\bigl(\\mathbb N,\\{(n,m,h)\\mid n,m\\in\\mathbb N,\\ h:[n]\\to[m]\\},\\ ((n,m,h)\\mapsto n),\\ ((n,m,h)\\mapsto m),\\ (n\\mapsto(n,n,1_{[n]})),\\ (((m,k,g),(n,m,h))\\mapsto(n,k,g\\circ h))\\bigr).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathcal B:=\\operatorname{FunCat}(\\mathbf{Fin},\\mathbf{Set}_{\\mathcal U}),\\qquad U:=\\bigl(n\\mapsto[n],\\ (n,m,h)\\mapsto([n],[m],h)\\bigr).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{IsObjectClassifier}(\\mathcal B,U).","display":true}],"bytes":1531,"backlinks":[{"id":"c53146be63465990","anchor":"ref-289","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-thm-finite-set-object-classifier|Theorem — 对象分类子的有限集合呈现]]"},{"id":"4741fef73eb1a614","anchor":"ref-225","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-thm-finite-set-object-classifier]]"},{"id":"c60ad289d123497b","anchor":"ref-290","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-thm-finite-set-object-classifier|Theorem — 对象分类子的有限集合呈现]]"}],"outgoing":["300365f146cacc8a","98293f53034b1166","1601eff2507fda14"]}